The SAM is a biennial 5-day event dedicated to the development of financial inclusion in Africa. It's the not-to-be-missed event for inclusive finance professionals!
 
The next edition will take place in Lomé, Togo, from October 16 to 20, 2023.
 
To experience the event even more intensely, download the app specially designed for SAM 2023 and :
 
View the complete event program, day by day;
• Create your own agenda by registering for the various workshops, training courses and conferences;
• View the profiles of other participants, speakers and innovators;
• Visit the virtual stands of sponsors, partners and exhibitors in the Innovators' Village;
• Chat with over 1,000 participants and arrange B2B meetings
• Receive live push information throughout the event
• Find your way around the Lomé International Conference Center.
 
We look forward to seeing you there!
 
The SAM team
